CONTEXT Diamond IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT Diamond
{+ Two included contexts each include the context Towns.
Each of them gets a copy of its own, so `Left.Geo.Town` and `Right.Geo.Town` are two concepts. +}

INCLUDE "../contexts/registry_with_towns.adl" AS Left
INCLUDE "../contexts/registry_with_towns.adl" AS Right

RELATION twinned[Left.Geo.Town*Right.Geo.Town]
POPULATION twinned[Left.Geo.Town*Right.Geo.Town] CONTAINS [ ("Enschede", "Heerlen") ]

ENDCONTEXT
